From: GeoSpec <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 11:57:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/9] mass: Add an adaptive Gauss-Kronrod mass-properties pass

One pass per face gives area, volume and the volume first moments with
globally adaptive Gauss-Kronrod 7-15 over the same integrand and smooth
pieces as the Cash-Karp integrator. Faces are independent tasks, run on
any number of threads and summed in face order, so results do not depend
on the thread count. brep_mass and brep_volume integrate a whole B-rep.
